  "verseCount": 37,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "17",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Chinkwana chinde chia Yeso",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 18:6-7,21-22; Mar 9:42)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso agateebia aborokigwa baye, “Amang’ana ’okogocha takomocha kooroka, korende obobe nobwaye omonto oria okoyarenta!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anga mbuya kobua ase omonto oria asungerwe orogena rogosia ase rigoti riaye, arutwe enyancha ime, kobua aragere oyomo bw’aba abake akore ebibe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erende; oyomino karakore ebibe, mokanie; karaonchoke, mwabere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende karakore ebibe ase ore ara gatano na kabere ase rituko erimo, karakoiranere ara gatano na kabere na goteeba: Naonchokire, mwabere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abatomwa bakamoteebia, “Omonene, tomentere okwegena gwaito.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene akabora, “Onye mwarenge nokwegena koreng’aine buna entetere y’omote onga buna omosabisabi, anga mwateebia omokenene oyo: Simoka, bwesimeke nyancha, noro anga nobaigwera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Korende ning’o ase more oyore nomosomba okorema, gose okorisia ching’ondi, oramoteebie ekero akorwa mogondo agosoa nyomba: Inchuo bwango oikaranse, orie endagera?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Takomoteebia: Ebeke ang’e, ondoiserie endagera goika indie inywe, na magega yaye, naye orie na konywa?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gose nkomoteebia are omosomba oria ng’a mbuya mono, ekiagera akora eki achikwa?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboigo nainwe, komorakore onsi aya mwachiikirwe, teba: ‘Intwe nabasomba bataisaneti; twakorire aya atogwenerete gokora.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso okogwenia abanto ikomi abarenge noborwaire bwa ukoma",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase enchera ekogenda Yerusalemu Yeso ngoeta arenge egati ya Samaria na Galili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero are gosoa omochie oyomo, akaumerana nabaanto ikomi abarenge noborwaire bwa ukoma, bateneine are;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na barabwo bagaaka eriogi bakaboora, “Yeso, Omonene, tororere amaabera!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agachia kobarora, akabateebia, “Genda mweorokie ase abakuani.” Kobakogenda bagasibeka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyomo obo agachia korora ng’a osibekire, akairana okomobaaka Nyasae ase eriogi rinene,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akagwa ase amagoro a Yeso, okomoiraneria ng’a mbuya mono, na ere n’Omosamaria orenge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akabora, “Tari bonsi ikomi basibeka? Baria kianda, ng’ai bare?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onde tanyorekanete oiranete komotogia Nyasae, otatiga omogeni oyo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akamoteebia, “Tenena, ogende; okwegena kwao gwakogwenirie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogocha kw’oborwoti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 24:26-28,37-41)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso agachia koborigwa n’Abafarisai, “Oborwoti bwa Nyasae indi borache?” Akabairaneria, “Oborwoti bwa Nyasae tibori gocha ase ebimanyererio bikororekana,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gose tibakobora: Rora naiga bore, gose: Naaria! Rora, oborwoti bwa Nyasae nigo bore ime ase more.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agateebia aborokigwa baye, “Amatuko nache morarigie korora rituko erimo ri’amatuko y’Omwana‐o‐Mwanyabaanto, korende timokorirora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende nabaabateebie: Rora aaria, gose: Rora aiga! Timogenda, gose timobatunyana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki buna okomesa gokomesa korwa igoro ensemo eyemo goika ensemo ende, nabo Omwana‐o‐Mwanyabaanto araache koba ase rituko riaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ritang’ani nagwenerete konyora ogochandwa okonge, na kwangwa nekegori eke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende buna yabeete ase amatuko a Nuhu, naboigo eraabe nase amatuko y’Omwana‐o‐Mwanyabaanto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barenge koria, bakonywa, bakonyuoma, bakonyuomerigwa, goika rituko riria Nuhu asoete ase obwato; etoigo egaacha, egasiria bonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboigo buna yabeete ase amatuko a Loti: Barenge koria na konywa, bakogora, koonia, bagosimeka, bakoagacha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ase rituko riria Loti aruete Sodomu omorero na ekebiriti bigatwa korwa igoro, bigasiria bonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboigo erache koba ase rituko riria Omwana‐o‐Mwanyabaanto araoroke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko riria oyore kerama igoro, na ebinto biaye bire nyomba ime, taika abibogorie; nere oyore mogondo naboigo tairana inka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moinyore moka Loti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
